{"lines": ["Three men vanished from a yacht with the engine running and dinner on the table.", "April two thousand seven. Three neighbours from Perth sail the catamaran Kaz II out of Airlie Beach, Australia.", "A helicopter spots her drifting off the Great Barrier Reef. Rescuers board and find the engine running.", "But nobody is aboard. A laptop is on. Food and cutlery are set out. The radio and GPS work, and the life jackets are still there.", "Only a shredded sail and a missing life raft look wrong.", "A coroner later proposes that one man fell off the stern freeing a fishing lure, and the others drowned trying to save him.", "Police found no sign of foul play. But relatives say hung-out laundry and stowed life jackets don't fit a sudden storm.", "Did one fall take all three men, as the coroner believes? Or is that table still a mystery?"], "words": [["Three", 0.0, 0.16], ["men", 0.16, 0.46], ["vanished", 0.46, 0.78], ["from", 0.78, 1.2], ["a", 1.2, 1.26], ["yacht", 1.26, 1.52], ["with", 1.52, 1.86], ["the", 1.86, 2.0], ["engine", 2.0, 2.26], ["running", 2.26, 2.78], ["and", 2.78, 3.06], ["dinner", 3.06, 3.3], ["on", 3.3, 3.6], ["the", 3.6, 3.68], ["table.", 3.68, 3.96], ["April", 4.481, 4.7], ["two", 4.7, 4.801], ["thousand", 4.801, 5.071], ["seven.", 5.071, 5.24], ["Three", 6.34, 6.4], ["neighbours", 6.4, 6.68], ["from", 6.68, 7.02], ["Perth", 7.02, 7.22], ["sail", 7.22, 7.64], ["the", 7.64, 7.9], ["catamaran", 7.9, 8.4], ["Kaz", 8.4, 8.7], ["II", 9.1, 9.42], ["out", 9.42, 9.74], ["of", 9.74, 9.86], ["Airlie", 9.86, 10.18], ["Beach,", 10.18, 10.56], ["Australia.", 10.76, 11.1], ["A", 11.76, 11.8], ["helicopter", 11.8, 12.18], ["spots", 12.18, 12.66], ["her", 12.66, 13.0], ["drifting", 13.0, 13.22], ["off", 13.22, 13.54], ["the", 13.54, 13.7], ["Great", 13.7, 13.92], ["Barrier", 13.92, 14.26], ["Reef.", 14.26, 14.64], ["Rescuers", 15.22, 15.72], ["board", 15.72, 15.92], ["and", 15.92, 16.22], ["find", 16.22, 16.42], ["the", 16.42, 16.64], ["engine", 16.64, 16.86